Scoped Creative Voice File (VOC)

The magic, codec tag table, probe, header check, block parser, rate
formulas and packet sizing in src/voc.ts follow libavformat/voc.c
(ff_voc_magic, ff_voc_codec_tags), voc.h, vocdec.c (voc_probe,
voc_read_header) and voc_packet.c (ff_voc_get_packet). The header,
block and terminator writer follows libavformat/vocenc.c
(voc_write_header, voc_write_packet, voc_write_trailer).
